'''KF Kosova VR Prishtinë''' ({{langx|sq|Klubi Futbollistik Kosova Vranjevc Prishtinë}}), commonly referred to as '''Kosova VR Prishtinë''' and colloquially known as '''Kosova VR''', is a [[Football team|football club]] based in Vranjevc, [[Pristina]], [[Kosovo]]. The club plays in the [[Third Football League of Kosovo]], which is the fourth tier of football in the country."}}
